graph TD
    classDef logic fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1565c0,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef db fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:2px;

    Test[Jest Test Runner]:::logic --> Code[Execute wCTE Query]:::logic
    Code --> TestContainer[(Docker PostgreSQL Container)]:::db
    TestContainer -- Return Data --> Code
    
    Code --> Assert[Expect Matcher]:::logic
    
    Stryker[Stryker Mutator]:::logic -.->|Injects Bugs| Code
    Stryker -.->|Expects Test Failure| Assert
